      "revision": {
        "title": "Qiyosiy daraja: taller than, bigger than",
        "description": "Ikki narsa/odamny taqqoslash: qisqa sifat + -er + than.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\nIkki narsa yoki odamni **taqqoslash** uchun sifatga **-er** qo'shamiz va **than** ishlatamiz: *My brother is **taller than** me.* — Akam mendan balandroq." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 4,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Qoida\n\n**qisqa sifat + -er + than**\n\n| Sifat | Qiyosiy |\n| --- | --- |\n| tall | **taller** |\n| old | **older** |\n| small | **smaller** |\n| big | **bigger** (oxirgi harf takrorlanadi) |\n| nice | **nicer** (faqat -r) |\n| happy | **happier** (y → i) |\n\nMisol: *A car is **faster than** a bike.*" }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- My brother is **taller than** me.\n- This box is **bigger than** that box.\n- Today is **hotter than** yesterday.\n- A train is **faster than** a car.\n- My sister is **older than** me." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-COMPARATIVES"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "My brother is ___ than me. (tall)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "taller" }, { "id": "b", "text": "more tall" }, { "id": "c", "text": "tallest" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Ko'p uchraydigan xato\n\n> Qisqa sifat bilan **more** ishlatilmaydi; **than** ni unutmang.\n>\n> Noto'g'ri: *more tall* → To'g'ri: **taller**\n> Noto'g'ri: *taller then me* → To'g'ri: **taller than me**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-COMPARATIVES"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-structured/v1", "format": "fill_blank", "prompt": "Bo'sh joyni to'ldiring (qiyosiy shakl, 'old'): opam mendan kattaroq.", "segments": [ { "text": "My sister is " }, { "blankId": "b1" }, { "text": " than me." } ], "blanks": { "b1": { "accepted": ["older"] } }, "normalization": { "caseFold": true, "collapseWhitespace": true }, "remediation": "old + er = older." }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-COMPARATIVES"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-structured/v1", "format": "sentence_order", "prompt": "So'zlardan gap tuzing: poyezd mashinadan tezroq.", "tokens": [ { "id": "t1", "text": "A" }, { "id": "t2", "text": "train" }, { "id": "t3", "text": "is" }, { "id": "t4", "text": "faster" }, { "id": "t5", "text": "than" }, { "id": "t6", "text": "a" }, { "id": "t7", "text": "car" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOrder": ["t1", "t2", "t3", "t4", "t5", "t6", "t7"] }, "remediation": "... is + faster + than + ..." }
