            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Xulosa\n\n- Qisqa sifat + **-er** + **than**: taller, older, bigger, faster.\n- *X is [sifat]er than Y.*" }
