    {
      "contentKey": "ENG-A1-026-WAS-WERE",
      "slug": "eng-a1-026-was-were",
      "sortOrder": 260,
      "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-WAS-WERE"],
      "prerequisiteContentKeys": ["ENG-A1-005-BE-QUESTIONS"],
      "revision": {
        "title": "was / were — o'tgan zamonda 'bo'lmoq'",
        "description": "am/is → was; are → were. Kecha qayerda/qanday bo'lganini aytish.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\n*am/is/are* (hozir) o'tgan zamonda **was / were** bo'ladi: *I **am** at home* → *I **was** at home yesterday.* Kecha qayerda yoki qanday bo'lganingizni ayta olasiz." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 4,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Qoida\n\n| Ega | Hozir | O'tgan |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| I | am | **was** |\n| he / she / it | is | **was** |\n| you / we / they | are | **were** |\n\n**Vaqt so'zlari:** yesterday, last week, in 2010.\n\nInkor: *I **wasn't** tired. They **weren't** here.*" }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- I **was** at school yesterday.\n- She **was** happy.\n- We **were** at home last night.\n- They **were** in Tashkent.\n- It **was** cold yesterday." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-WAS-WERE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "We ___ at home yesterday.", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "was" }, { "id": "b", "text": "were" }, { "id": "c", "text": "are" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Ko'p uchraydigan xato\n\n> I/he/she/it bilan **was**; you/we/they bilan **were**.\n>\n> Noto'g'ri: *We was at home.* → To'g'ri: **We were at home.**\n> Noto'g'ri: *She were happy.* → To'g'ri: **She was happy.**" }
          },
          {
